{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "purpose": "What a block of a mod this game does not load becomes when a private 1.18.2 Lost Cities pack is ported (scripts/port_lostcities_pack.py, scripts/block_lookalikes.py): the nearest look of a block the game has, so a building keeps its walls, floors, windows and furniture instead of holes. It names only public mods' block ids and naming patterns, never anybody's buildings. Rules are tried in order; the first whose pattern matches the whole block id and whose result the real registry has wins. A result may use the pattern's groups (\\1) and the derived names {material} (the block's wood, stone, metal or colour read from its id) and {shape} (stairs, slab, wall, fence, ...). 'air' is said on purpose and counted; anything no rule reaches falls to the shape rules, then to air, and is listed in the port report.",
